  "body": "This is a \"maybe\" issue, but some elements of [PEP 249](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0249/) have already been implicitly coded into the codebase, such as `synapse.storage.types`, however, it could be easier to directly work with PEP 249's DB-API-v2 schema and approach to simplify the storage framework even further, and make (potential) future database engines easier to support.\r\n\r\n(Things such as module [`.threadsafety`](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0249/#threadsafety) properties can maybe help futher granularize database pooling mechanisms dynamically.)",
